menu "Debugger"

    config EMUDBG
        bool "Debugger for programs in the machine"
        default y
        help
            Breakpoints, single steps, registers and memory of the emulated
            CPUs over the network, for the VS Code extension (esp32emu-vscode)
            or anything else that speaks its protocol (esp32emu's
            docs/debugger.md). Without a client the CPU cores test one
            pointer per instruction.

    config EMUDBG_PORT
        int "TCP port"
        depends on EMUDBG
        default 6502

endmenu
